{
  "entry": "greeting",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "greeting",
      "text": "Mara is chalking names onto a patrol board. 'Six volunteers, five dry cloaks. We can mend a cloak; we cannot mend a bad rota.'",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "ask_life",
          "text": "Tell me about life here.",
          "next": "life"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_concern",
          "text": "Is anything on your mind?",
          "next": "concern",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "mara_decision",
              "state": "eq",
              "value": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "remember_a",
          "text": "How did our earlier discussion turn out?",
          "next": "outcome_a",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "mara_decision",
              "state": "eq",
              "value": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "remember_b",
          "text": "How did our earlier discussion turn out?",
          "next": "outcome_b",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "mara_decision",
              "state": "eq",
              "value": 2
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_work",
          "text": "Do you know of a local job?",
          "next": "work"
        },
        {
          "id": "goodbye",
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "next": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "life",
      "text": "'Ironward keeps watchposts supplied and escorts people who cannot afford private guards. Most days our fiercest opponent is a broken axle.'",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "personal_topic",
          "text": "Discuss a warrior's training.",
          "next": "personal",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "class",
              "id": "warrior"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "life_back",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "concern",
      "text": "'A new volunteer wants the busiest route. Her mother asks me to keep her near town. What would you advise?'",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "decide_a",
          "text": "Pair her with an experienced warden on the busy route.",
          "next": "outcome_a",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "mara_decision",
              "state": "eq",
              "value": 0
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "mara_decision",
              "value": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "standing",
              "id": "ironward",
              "value": 2
            }
          ],
          "once": true,
          "result": "Mara remembered your advice: Pair her with an experienced warden on the busy route."
        },
        {
          "id": "decide_b",
          "text": "Let her learn the town circuit first.",
          "next": "outcome_b",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "mara_decision",
              "state": "eq",
              "value": 0
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "flag",
              "id": "mara_decision",
              "value": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "standing",
              "id": "ironward",
              "value": 2
            }
          ],
          "once": true,
          "result": "Mara remembered your advice: Let her learn the town circuit first."
        },
        {
          "id": "concern_back",
          "text": "I need to think about it.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "outcome_a",
      "text": "'Responsibility with support. I can do that.' The volunteer returns next week with muddy boots and an excellent report.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "outcome_a_back",
          "text": "Until next time.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "outcome_b",
      "text": "'Practice is not cowardice.' Mara gives the volunteer responsibility for the market circuit, not another week of sweeping.",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "outcome_b_back",
          "text": "Until next time.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "work",
      "text": "Roadside Supplies: Collect a fresh supply bundle from the caravan cache in Barren Plains. 'I can register your interest here; any guild hall handles payment.'",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "accept_work",
          "text": "Accept Roadside Supplies.",
          "next": "greeting",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "type": "quest",
              "id": "commission_supplies",
              "state": "available"
            }
          ],
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "quest",
              "id": "commission_supplies"
            }
          ],
          "once": true,
          "result": "You accepted Roadside Supplies. Follow its lead and return to a guild hall for payment."
        },
        {
          "id": "work_back",
          "text": "Not now.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "personal",
      "text": "'You know how to hold a line. Teaching someone else when to step back is the harder lesson.'",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "personal_back",
          "text": "Thank you.",
          "next": "greeting"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
